==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
** 4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading your [[Worker Cat]]. When the Snaches come close to the [[Cat Base]], send out a few [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]]. Meanwhile, just keep upgrading your Worker Cat until it has reached max level. When Jackie Peng appears, send out a few [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]] with meatshields and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]]. Even a Gory can't survive this combination of units.

At this point, you will have a lot of money, so spawn [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]]. Fish Cat in particular will be great against Pigge and Sir Seal.

